  on 2026-11-11T19:07:07.022040+00:00

decision 2
  question "Which columns hold personal data (name, email, account number...), and which outputs may receive them - e.g. email, only the internal output - or none?"
  answer "None: the output holds no personal data"
  by architect@example.com
  on 2026-11-11T19:07:07.221374+00:00

